    skos:prefLabel 'autonomous platform piloting pressure sensor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An underwater pressure sensor that is mounted within an autonomous platform such as a glider. The data are used to determine the depth of the sensor below the sea surface for piloting and navigation purposes only.'@en ;
